\description{
\if{html}{\out{
<a href="https://adrientaudiere.github.io/MiscMetabar/articles/Rules.html#lifecycle">
<img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/lifecycle-experimental-orange" alt="lifecycle-experimental"></a>
